        <mxCell id="shir-compute-role" value="• Outbound HTTPS 443 Polling: Regularly checks ADF command queue&#xa;• Local Query Dispatcher: Executes SQL queries on localhost:1433 via ODBC&#xa;• In-Memory Compute Engine: Serializes extracted SQL rows into Snappy Parquet&#xa;• Stream Pusher: Direct TLS 1.3 upload stream to ADLS Gen2 DFS endpoint&#xa;• Zero Attack Surface: Never listens on public ports; hospital firewall intact" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#A7F3D0;fontColor=#047857;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=12;lineHeight=1.5;" vertex="1" parent="shir-gateway-box">
